{"id":20939,"date":"2019-03-04T11:28:39","date_gmt":"2019-03-04T05:58:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/?post_type=astra-sites&#038;p=20939"},"modified":"2024-01-23T22:30:28","modified_gmt":"2024-01-23T17:00:28","slug":"interior-designer-2","status":"publish","type":"astra-sites","link":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/astra-site\/interior-designer-2\/","title":{"rendered":"Interior Designer"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The Interior Designer template has a crisp, modern feel you would expect of the niche. It has a contemporary look with simple navigation, integrated slideshow below the fold and a section about you front and center.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The template uses simple colors and layout, along with modern fonts to let your images and content stand out. It\u2019s a very refined design that shows you at your best while also selling you in a subtle way. It\u2019s all the template you need if you\u2019re a designer.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key features of the Interior Designer template<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Simple, understated design with clever features<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Flexible image and content areas<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Plenty of opportunities to showcase projects and services<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Crisp and modern feel ideal for the niche<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Full compatibility with leading page builders<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Crisp, modern template that fits the design and creative niches perfectly<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":190,"featured_media":47046,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"inline_featured_image":false,"_surecart_dashboard_logo_width":"180px","_surecart_dashboard_show_logo":true,"_surecart_dashboard_navigation_orders":true,"_surecart_dashboard_navigation_invoices":true,"_surecart_dashboard_navigation_subscriptions":true,"_surecart_dashboard_navigation_downloads":true,"_surecart_dashboard_navigation_billing":true,"_surecart_dashboard_navigation_accou